# RateInterfaceUnitsVectorNeuron.nestml
# ######################################
#
# Rates (the quantity "1 / time") are stored in 1/ms in NEST, but set, read and recorded by the user in Hz. This model checks the conversion for vector variables.
#
#
# Copyright statement
# +++++++++++++++++++
